=Here is the policy eligibility data received from Agent 1.
Use this to conduct the eligibility interview.

Policy Context:
Eligibility Conditions: {{ $json.eligibility_summary }}
Required Documents: {{ $json.required_documents }}
How to Apply: {{ $json.how_to_apply }}
Issuing Authority Contact: {{ $json.issuing_authority_contact }}

Latest User Message (reply to your last question):
{{ $('Webhook - WebApp').item.json.body.answer ?? '' }}

Instructions:
- If the latest user message is empty, this is the FIRST message — ask the opening confirmation question only, nothing else
- If user said yes, begin asking eligibility questions one by one
- If conversation history has all answers, evaluate and return final JSON verdict
- If eligible or partially eligible, query the RAG knowledge base for other matching schemes and include them in your response
